  <div class="section">
    <h2>Syllabus</h2>
    <p>Dr. <span data-field="instructor.last_name">{{ instructor.last_name }}</span></p>
    <p>OFFICE: <span data-field="instructor.office_location">{{ instructor.office_location }}</span></p>
    <p>OFFICE PHONE: <span data-field="instructor.phone">{{ instructor.phone }}</span></p>
    <p>E-MAIL: <span data-field="instructor.email">{{ instructor.email }}</span></p>
    <p>OFFICE HOURS: <span data-field="instructor.office_hours">{{ instructor.office_hours }}</span></p>
    <p>This course is a Web Course and is conducted within Canvas <a href="http://utpb.instructure.com">http://utpb.instructure.com</a>.</p>
    <p>NOTE: The due dates and times for the activities will adhere to the Central Time Zone.</p>
